        "One barber.One chair. Your full appointment.",
        "Chair and Blade is a one-to-one barber studio tucked into Manchester's St John Street quarter. No queue, no second chair, no rushing — just one seat, one pair of hands, and your full time slot.",
        "St John Street, Manchester",
        "1 BarberEvery appointment, every time",
        "1 ChairNo shared floor, no waiting room queue",
        "By AppointmentTue–Sat, one client at a time"
      ]
    },
