      "text": [
        "Jamie Ashworth",
        "Chair and Blade started as a simple idea: a haircut should feel like it's just for you. After a decade cutting hair across busy Manchester shops, Jamie set up a single-chair studio on St John Street where every booking gets his complete attention — no gaps in service, no half-finished conversations,",
        "Every cut is planned around your face shape, your hair, and how you actually style it day to day, not a five-minute template. Whether it's a sharp skin fade, a classic scissor cut, or a beard reshape, the studio only ever books one person at a time.",
        "— Jamie"
      ]
    },
